# Agent Failure Triage Platform - System Walkthrough & Golden Benchmark Report

## 🚀 Executive Summary

The **Agent Failure Triage Platform** operates as an automated diagnostic SRE agent for multi-step AI agent workflows. It ingests raw telemetry traces, normalizes tokens, deterministically verifies evidence citations with zero hallucination, classifies root causes into an 8-layer comprehensive production failure matrix, and runs automated regression benchmarks.

