## 💻 How to Run & Verify

### 1. Generate Golden Dataset
```bash
python -m data.generate_dataset
```

### 2. Run Benchmark Suite (50 Golden Cases)
```bash
python -m src.evaluate
```

### 3. Run Pytest Suite
```bash
pytest tests/ -v
```

### 4. Launch FastAPI Server & SRE Dashboard
```bash
python -m uvicorn src.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8080 --reload
```
Open **`http://localhost:8080`** in your browser to interact with the **SRE Control Dashboard**.
